[75.25623, "o", "\u001b[2D\u001b[4B\r\u001b[7A\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThinking for \u001b[1m7s\u001b[22m… \u001b[38;5;246m(ctrl+o to expand)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  \u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mThe user is asking me to say \"hello world\". This is a very simple request. According to my instructions, I should check for memory at the beginning. The user \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3minstructions say: \"2. Memory Retrieval: - Always begin your chat by saying only \"Remembering...\" and retrieve all relevant information from your knowledge graph - Always\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m   \u001b[6G\u001b[2m\u001b[3mrefer to your knowledge graph as your \"memory\"\" So I should start by saying \"Remembering...\" and try to retrieve memory. However, I need to use the memory MCP server \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3mfor this. Let me check if I have access to memory tools. Looking at the system reminders, I see there's a memory MCP server mentioned in the CLAUDE.md file, and I see \u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m\u001b[3mthere are deferred tools available. I should search for memory-related tools. Actually, wait. The instructions say \"Always begin your chat by saying only \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m   \u001b[2m\u001b[3m'Remembering...' and retrieve all relevant information from your knowledge graph\". But this is such a simple request - just to say \"hello world\". I should still follow \u001b[23m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[2m\u001b[3mthe\u001b[10Gprotocol\u001b[19Gthough.\u001b[27GLet\u001b[31Gme\u001b[34Gsearch\u001b[41Gfor\u001b[45Gmemory\u001b[52Gtools\u001b[58Gfirst.\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;174m*\u001b[3GCrystallizing…\u001b[18G\u001b[38;5;246m(7s\u001b[22G·\u001b[24G↓\u001b[26G38\u001b[29Gtokens\u001b[36G·\u001b[38G\u001b[38;5;249mthinking\u001b[38;5;246m)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246m[08:41:13]\u001b[14G/home/devashish/workspace/ric03uec/lmstack/website/static/decks/ai-tinkerers\u001b[91Gon\u001b[94Ggit:main\u001b[103G*\u001b[105G|\u001b[107GSonnet\u001b[114G4.5\u001b[118G(2.1.221)\u001b[128G|\u001b[130G$0.0000\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246m⏸\u001b[5Gmanual\u001b[12Gmode\u001b[17Gon\u001b[20G·\u001b[22G←\u001b[24Gfor\u001b[28Gagents\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[4A"]
